{"5114970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Let's Tidy Up! Backrooms", "steam_appid": 5114970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BACKROOMS ARE A MESS. SOMEONE HAS TO CLEAN THEM UP. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📼  SORT THE TAPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize a seemingly endless collection of recordings recovered from the expeditions into Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗄️ ORGANIZE THE ARCHIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match recordings, labels, categories, and anomalies to their proper place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤐 DON'T ASK QUESTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fragments of information as you work. Just don't watch anything you weren't supposed to find.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BACKROOMS ARE A MESS. SOMEONE HAS TO CLEAN THEM UP. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📼  SORT THE TAPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize a seemingly endless collection of recordings recovered from the expeditions into Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗄️ ORGANIZE THE ARCHIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match recordings, labels, categories, and anomalies to their proper place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤐 DON'T ASK QUESTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fragments of information as you work. Just don't watch anything you weren't supposed to find.</p>", "short_description": "An organizing simulator about sorting videotapes recovered from The Backrooms. Find strange footage, catalogue anomalies, uncover unsettling secrets and transform a chaotic mess into a neatly organized archive. But be careful - some recordings don't behave like ordinary videos...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.